{
    "_comment": "Llama-3.2-1B IPTTCDv9 v2 (init massage, full attention) for ProLong CT. 16-layer model with TTT layers at [0,5,10,15] (every ~5 layers, mirrors Qwen3 v2 [0,7,14,21] pattern at 4 TTT layers / 16 hidden = 25% of layers).",

